{"title":"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of the digits in the answer to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a45c7afffabeee78e3e8a15da3e8b637c650247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underbrace{9999\\cdots 99}_{94\\text{ nines}} \\times \\underbrace{4444\\cdots 44}_{94\\text{ fours}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"185\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>where a string of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698a90ad1ee1841d9c2a4a80e0a32cbd6b252181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> nines is multiplied by a string of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698a90ad1ee1841d9c2a4a80e0a32cbd6b252181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> fours.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378f590b2658475373b85360d9828f0685879355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 846 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 855 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 945 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 954 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 1072$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/7/2077b57b45b2a11f1c76fae975463c7fd5b418fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\cdot 4 = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/d/05d863f980bceb8f46a352480d3d01a98f538d36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+6 = 9 = 9 \\cdot 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"128\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/2/ae24c21c3c138cc9e35b44117c22c55eb83ee093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99 \\cdot 44 = 4356$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/0/5e02bd0fed67b4b30d4ed149f2439c0557a2d6ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+5+3+6 = 18 = 9 \\cdot 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"200\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>So the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> 9s times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> 4s is simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8f7a916abd7563cfd9f1d46078e75e14ca4bf49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\cdot 9$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" /> (Try to find the proof that it works for all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> ~MATHWIZARD10).\n</p><p>Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/8/1a8441898139a61d3423109052bf264dd72c260e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94 \\cdot 9 = \\boxed{\\text{(A)}\\ 846.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"139\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/5/675f26d0d0590b495cb6b9b606c3cadf3c5d038a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\underbrace{9999\\cdots 99}_{94\\text{ nines}} \\cdot \\underbrace{4444\\cdots 44}_{94\\text{ fours}} = (10^{94}-1)\\cdot \\underbrace{4444\\cdots 44}_{94\\text{ fours}} = \\underbrace{444\\cdots 4}_{94\\text{ fours}} \\underbrace{000\\cdots 0}_{94\\text{ zeros}} - \\underbrace{4444\\cdots 44}_{94\\text{ fours}} = \\underbrace{444\\cdots 4}_{93\\text{ fours}} 3 \\underbrace{555\\cdots 5}_{93\\text{ fives}}6\\]\" width=\"790\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e670aff931f8a870df600bfa69d092ead3454350.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4 \\cdot 93 + 3 + 5 \\cdot 93 + 6 = 9 \\cdot 94 = \\boxed{\\text{(A)}\\ 846}\\]\" width=\"324\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p><p><br />\n~Minor edit by wimpykid\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME\" title=\"1994 AJHSME\">1994 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last <br /> Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=